  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "slide-01",
      "order": 1,
      "type": "cover",
      "title": "模拟法：让状态按规则一步步变化",
      "html": "<section><h1>模拟法：让状态按规则一步步变化</h1><p>得分 · 坐标 · 方向 · 多状态</p><div class=\"flow\"><span>定义状态</span><b>→</b><span>执行操作</span><b>→</b><span>判断结束</span></div></section>",
      "notes": "用棋子移动或记分牌导入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-02",
      "order": 2,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "本课达标线",
      "html": "<div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><h3>状态说清</h3><p>指出每个变量表示什么</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>更新有序</h3><p>按题目顺序改变状态</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>边界不漏</h3><p>处理起点、终点与越界</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>独立完成</h3><p>知识竞赛/移动坐标达到A</p></article></div>",
      "notes": "只讲学生能做到什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-03",
      "order": 3,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "什么是模拟法",
      "html": "<section><h2>什么是模拟法</h2><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><h3>状态</h3><p>当前全部关键信息</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>规则</h3><p>一次输入如何改变状态</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>终止</h3><p>何时停止并输出</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>轨迹</h3><p>初态到终态的变化序列</p></article></div><p><strong>核心：</strong>不猜答案，忠实执行规则。</p></section>",
      "notes": "对比枚举与模拟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-04",
      "order": 4,
      "type": "steps",
      "title": "模拟三问",
      "html": "<section><h2>动手前先回答三问</h2><div class=\"flow\"><span>现在是什么状态？</span><b>→</b><span>本步做什么？</span><b>→</b><span>何时结束？</span></div></section>",
      "notes": "板书状态—操作—终止。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-05",
      "order": 5,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "状态表：最可靠的草稿",
      "html": "<section><h2>状态表：最可靠的草稿</h2><pre>step input row col dir score\n0    -     2   3   0   0\n1    R     2   3   1   0\n2    F     2   4   1   1</pre><p>每行记录一次操作后的状态，第一处不同就是错误起点。</p></section>",
      "notes": "让学生补下一行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-06",
      "order": 6,
      "type": "code",
      "title": "得分模拟：更新后立刻判定",
      "html": "<section><h2>得分模拟：更新后立刻判定</h2><pre>if (winner == 'A') ++scoreA;\nelse ++scoreB;\nif (scoreA &gt;= target &amp;&amp; scoreA-scoreB &gt;= 2) finished=true;</pre><p>先加分，再检查“至少”和“领先”。</p></section>",
      "notes": "用10:10、11:10、12:10追问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-07",
      "order": 7,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "坐标先约定，再更新",
      "html": "<section><h2>坐标先约定，再更新</h2><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><h3>行列坐标</h3><p>row向下、col向右增加</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>平面坐标</h3><p>x向右、y向上增加</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>题面优先</h3><p>严格按题意约定</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>单步测试</h3><p>手算向上和向右各一步</p></article></div></section>",
      "notes": "强调坐标约定不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-08",
      "order": 8,
      "type": "code",
      "title": "方向数组：四个方向统一写",
      "html": "<section><h2>方向数组：四个方向统一写</h2><pre>int dr[4]={-1,0,1,0};\nint dc[4]={0,1,0,-1};\nrow+=dr[dir]; col+=dc[dir];</pre><p>0上1右2下3左；顺时针：<code>dir=(dir+1)%4</code>。</p></section>",
      "notes": "学生口述方向编号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-09",
      "order": 9,
      "type": "code",
      "title": "边界判断要在正确时机",
      "html": "<section><h2>边界判断要在正确时机</h2><pre>int nr=row+dr[dir], nc=col+dc[dir];\nif(0&lt;=nr &amp;&amp; nr&lt;n &amp;&amp; 0&lt;=nc &amp;&amp; nc&lt;m){\n  row=nr; col=nc;\n}</pre><p>先算候选，再判断，最后移动。</p></section>",
      "notes": "对比先移动再撤销。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-10",
      "order": 10,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "位置分类：特殊情况优先",
      "html": "<section><h2>位置分类：特殊情况优先</h2><div class=\"flow\"><span>四个角</span><b>→</b><span>四条边</span><b>→</b><span>中间区域</span></div><p>角同时属于两条边，所以优先判断角。</p></section>",
      "notes": "用画画题验证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-11",
      "order": 11,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "多状态：新旧状态不要混",
      "html": "<section><h2>多状态：新旧状态不要混</h2><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><h3>原地更新</h3><p>后续可能读到本轮新值</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>临时变量</h3><p>先算next再覆盖current</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>新数组</h3><p>整轮读old写next</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>不变量</h3><p>每轮结束必须保持的事实</p></article></div></section>",
      "notes": "数组清零重点追问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-12",
      "order": 12,
      "type": "code",
      "title": "数组清零：每轮三个动作",
      "html": "<section><h2>数组清零：每轮三个动作</h2><pre>while(!allZero){\n  findRightmostMaximum();\n  findMinimumPositive();\n  a[maxPos]-=minPositive; ++operations;\n}</pre><p>每轮都要重新寻找。</p></section>",
      "notes": "用[2,3,4]手算两轮。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-13",
      "order": 13,
      "type": "content",
      "title": "例题：知识竞赛记分牌",
      "html": "<section><h2>例题：知识竞赛记分牌</h2><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><h3>状态</h3><p>A分、B分、当前题号</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>输入</h3><p>答对方或无人得分</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>更新</h3><p>按规则增加或扣除</p></article><article class=\"card\"><h3>终止</h3><p>题目用完或提前获胜</p></article></div><p>每读一个事件，只完成一次状态转移。</p></section>",
      "notes": "先画状态表。"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-14",
      "order": 14,
      "type": "questions",
      "title": "随堂练习 1—4",
      "html": "<section><h2>随堂练习 1—4</h2><ol start=\"1\"><li>模拟法解决问题时，最先应明确什么？</li><li>只要程序按题意逐步执行，就不需要检查状态更新的先后顺序。</li><li>按行列坐标约定，点(row,col)向右移动1格应如何更新？</li><li>dx={-1,0,1,0}、dy={0,1,0,-1}中，下标1表示？</li></ol></section><button class=\"answer-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\">点击显示答案</button><div class=\"answer-panel\" hidden><ol start=\"1\"><li><b>A</b>：模拟的核心是定义状态、操作和更新顺序。</li><li><b>F</b>：同一轮中先后顺序可能改变后续读取到的状态。</li><li><b>C</b>：向右移动使列号增加。</li><li><b>B</b>：变化量是(0,1)，表示向右。</li></ol></div>",
      "notes": "先作答再显示。",
      "audience": "teacher",
      "questionRefs": [
